# SHADOW Terminal colour scheme — "SHADOW Neon".
# Original work for Shadow OS. SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# A high-contrast neon palette on a deep obsidian black: vivid cyan, magenta
# and spring-green accents that glow against the near-black ground while normal
# text stays a cool, legible white (WCAG AA on the background).

[Background]
Color=#04060A

[BackgroundIntense]
Color=#0C1420

[BackgroundFaint]
Color=#04060A

